{
  "id": "stockpile_volumes",
  "title": "Stockpile Volumes",
  "description": "Calculate volumes and mass of natural stockpiles. This tool provides calculators for both coned (conical) and rectangular pile configurations, using diameter/base dimensions, height, and material density.",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Stockpile Volumes Calculator\n\nCalculate the volume and mass of stockpiles using the following configurations:\n\n- **Coned Pile**: Based on diameter and height (conical shape)\n- **Rectangular Pile**: Based on length, width, and height (rectangular prism shape)\n\nFormulas:\n- **Coned Pile Volume**: V = (π/12) × D² × H\n- **Rectangular Pile Volume**: V = L × W × H\n- **Mass**: m = ρ × V\n\nwhere:\n- D = diameter (m or ft)\n- H = height (m or ft)\n- L = length (m or ft)\n- W = width (m or ft)\n- ρ = density (kg/m³ or lb/ft³)\n- V = volume (m³ or ft³)\n- m = mass (kg or lb)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Coned Pile Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "cone_diameter",
          "label": "Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "cone_height",
          "label": "Height",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 4,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "cone_density",
          "label": "Material Density",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1500,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "cone_volume",
          "label": "Volume",
          "formula": "(3.14159 / 12) * (inputs.cone_diameter ^ 2) * inputs.cone_height",
          "unit": "m³",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "cone_mass",
          "label": "Total Mass",
          "formula": "inputs.cone_density * ((3.14159 / 12) * (inputs.cone_diameter ^ 2) * inputs.cone_height)",
          "unit": "kg",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Rectangular Pile Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "rect_length",
          "label": "Length",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "rect_width",
          "label": "Width",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 15,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "rect_height",
          "label": "Height",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "rect_density",
          "label": "Material Density",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1500,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "rect_volume",
          "label": "Volume",
          "formula": "inputs.rect_length * inputs.rect_width * inputs.rect_height",
          "unit": "m³",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "rect_mass",
          "label": "Total Mass",
          "formula": "inputs.rect_density * (inputs.rect_length * inputs.rect_width * inputs.rect_height)",
          "unit": "kg",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Material Type",
        "Typical Density (kg/m³)",
        "Notes"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Anthracite Coal",
          "1041",
          "Converted from 65 lb/ft³"
        ],
        [
          "Sand",
          "1600",
          "Loose, dry"
        ],
        [
          "Gravel",
          "1750",
          "Mixed sizes"
        ],
        [
